in the United States."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0434-56d078fd4aad:d03", "start": 185, "end": 325, "text": "A reflection of his musical studies, Jackson was inspired by a variety of classic R & B, pop, rock, and jazz artists such as Chicago, S.O.S."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0434-56d078fd4aad:d03", "start": 326, "end": 402, "text": "Band, Ella Fitzgerald, and Sarah Vaughn during the production of Faithfully."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0434-56d078fd4aad:d03", "start": 403, "end": 480, "text": "The result, a sample-heavy album, which the label described as `` old school."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0434-56d078fd4aad:d03", "start": 481, "end": 484, "text": "```"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0434-56d078fd4aad:d04", "start": 0, "end": 136, "text": "Faithfully (Jovit Baldivino album) Faithfully is the debut album of Jovit Baldivino, the first grand champion of \"Pilipinas Got Talent\"."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0434-56d078fd4aad:d04", "start": 137, "end": 235, "text": "The album was released on July 2010 under Star Records in cooperation with Sony Music Philippines."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0434-56d078fd4aad:d04", "start": 236, "end": 385, "text": "The album debuted at number one with approximate sales of 10,000 units, becoming one of the best sales week for an album in the Philippines for 2010."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0434-56d078fd4aad:d04", "start": 386, "end": 578, "text": "It stayed at number one for seven consecutive weeks, selling in excess of 4,000 copies each week, bringing his total of 60,000 copies and received a triple platinum recognition for this album."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0434-56d078fd4aad:d04", "start": 579, "end": 609, "text": "The 12-track album consists of"}, "D6S1": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0434-56